[Q-02]: `.agents/skills/repo-terminal-operator/async-control-plane.ts:projectAsyncControl` 如何把 lifecycle、result transaction 與 progress records 投影成 dispatch、await、recover、foreground-admission、repair-or-close 或 closed，且在新增 redrive 或 orphan 處理時必須保留哪些「只投影、不執行」界線？
